headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

auth {
  mode: none
}

docs {
  # SummonStack API

  The portal authenticates with an HttpOnly `ss_session` cookie. Bruno's cookie
  jar stores it automatically, so **run `Auth / Login` first** and every later
  request in the same session is authenticated as that account.

  Admin routes additionally require GM level 3 on the logged-in account.
}
